# Design Request Quality Bar

For **any new design request**, deliver outcomes that meet or exceed the quality of the canonical reference pages and are fully aligned with the brand.

## Canonical References

Use these as the quality bar. New designs must be **consistent** with them:

| Reference | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `account-settings.html` | Forms, sections, profile patterns |
| `dashboard-enhanced.html` | Layout, cards, stats, navigation |
| `wallet-enhanced.html` | Data tables, transactions, wallet UI |
| `add-money.html` | Stepper flows, amount inputs, CTAs |
| `exchange.html` | Multi-step flows, dropdowns, confirm screens |
| `brand-style-guide.html` | **Source of truth** — colors, typography, gradients, spacing, motion |

## Required Outcomes for Every Design Request

### 1. Responsiveness

- **Breakpoints**: Match reference pages — `≤768px` (nav → hamburger, single-column), `≤480px` (compact layout)
- **Touch targets**: Min 44px height for nav items, 46px for buttons
- **Inputs**: `font-size: 1rem` on mobile to prevent iOS zoom
- **Grids**: `repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr))` or collapse to `1fr` at 768px

### 2. Accessibility

- **Skip link**: First element in body, `href="#main-content"`
- **Reduced motion**: `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` — animations/transitions to 0.01ms
- **Focus**: Visible focus ring (`outline: 2–3px solid var(--primary-green); outline-offset: 2px`) on all interactive elements
- **ARIA**: `role`, `aria-label`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-current` where appropriate
- **Contrast**: WCAG AA minimum (4.5:1 text, 3:1 UI)

### 3. Design Visual Styling / Quality

- **Tokens only**: Use CSS variables from `:root` — never hardcode hex values that have a token
- **Typography**: Space Grotesk only; use `--font-display` / `--font-body`
- **Cards**: `border-radius: 1.25rem`, `border: 2px solid var(--border-subtle)`, white background
- **Buttons**: `.btn-primary` (gradient), `.btn-secondary` (outline); min-height 46px
- **Page titles**: Gradient text (`background: var(--gradient-primary); -webkit-background-clip: text`)

### 4. Brand Alignment (`brand-style-guide.html`)

- **Colors**: Primary green `#10B981`, primary blue `#0EA5E9`, accent pink `#EC4899`; neutrals 50–900
- **Gradients**: `--gradient-primary` (green→blue), `--gradient-sky`, `--gradient-warm`
- **Spacing**: 22px container, 44px nav, 110px section; follow spacing principles
- **Motion**: Organic flow; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`

## Checklist Before Delivering

- [ ] Responsive at 768px and 480px
- [ ] Skip link + reduced motion + focus styles
- [ ] No hardcoded colors — tokens only
- [ ] Space Grotesk, card/button patterns from references
- [ ] Matches or exceeds visual quality of `account-settings.html`, `dashboard-enhanced.html`, `wallet-enhanced.html`, `add-money.html`, `exchange.html`
- [ ] Aligned with `brand-style-guide.html` (colors, typography, spacing, motion)

## What NOT to Do

- ❌ Introduce new fonts, colors, or layout patterns not in the references
- ❌ Lower the accessibility bar (skip link, focus, reduced motion)
- ❌ Use fixed widths that break on small screens
- ❌ Deliver designs that feel inconsistent with the existing product
